<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka on bourse's main mkt April 23.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka on bourse's main mkt April 23.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Jutrzenka SA, listed on the bourse's parallel market, will start trade on the main floor on April 23, the stock exchange said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
